This repository is licensed in two parts.

  CODE — MIT, the text below.
    Everything that runs or builds: _includes/, _layouts/, assets/, tools/,
    the configuration, and all proof-of-concept and research code under
    research/.

  PROSE — Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International.
    The write-ups themselves: _posts/, _drafts/, about.md and the other page
    copy. See LICENSE-CONTENT.

Third-party code vendored under assets/vendor/ keeps its own licence; see
assets/vendor/README.md for what is there and where it came from.

The split is deliberate. Proof-of-concept code exists to be run, adapted and
built on, so it carries the most permissive licence that still requires
attribution. The write-ups are authored work, and CC BY asks for credit while
still allowing republication and translation.

